        "a": "Students should follow the same 8 steps as working reporters: pick an angle with clear news value, gather documents and at least two human sources, record interviews with permission, write a one-sentence lead, order the body by importance, attribute every fact, check every name and number, and add a headline. School stories still need named sources."
